{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"群的外自同构"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"群的外自同构"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>定义"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":" $G$ 的<strong>外自同构群</strong> (outer automorphism group) 为其"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ 作为"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的自同构群的 $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Out}(G)&amp;:=\r\n\\tau_{\\leq 0}\r\n(\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Grp}}(G) /_{\\mathrm{Ad}} G)\\\\\r\n&amp; =\\tau_{\\leq 0}\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}